<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia IGB Corp 1996 net up 88 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia IGB Corp 1996 net up 88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 116.45   vs	  62.07</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 24.7    vs	  13.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   833.40   vs	 593.88</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   147.30   vs	  83.87</p>
<p>    Minorities	  add    0.54   vs  less   0.02</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   14.71   vs	  24.51</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	  5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - IGB Corp Bhd is a property development and construction concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
